# search_lcbo_products
**Type:** tool
**Module:** packages.haive-tools.src.haive.tools.toolkits.lcbo_toolkit
**Class:** StructuredTool

## Description
Search for LCBO products by keyword, name, etc.

## Schema
```json
{
  "description": "Input schema for searching LCBO products.\n\nArgs:\n    query: The search terms to find matching products\n    page: Page number for paginated results\n    per_page: Number of results to return per page",
  "properties": {
    "query": {
      "description": "Search query string",
      "title": "Query",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "page": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": 1,
      "description": "Page number of results",
      "title": "Page"
    },
    "per_page": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "type": "integer"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": 10,
      "description": "Number of results per page",
      "title": "Per Page"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "query"
  ],
  "title": "SearchLCBOProductsInput",
  "type": "object"
}
```

